{"seq":7,"slug":"lc0100-same-tree","title":"LeetCode 100 相同的树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0100-same-tree","wordCount":938,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-100-相同的树\">LeetCode 100 相同的树</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你两棵二叉树的根节点 <code>p</code> 和 <code>q</code>，编写一个函数来检验这两棵树是否相同。</p>\n<p>如果两个树在结构上相同，并且节点具有相同的值，则认为它们是相同的。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>两棵树的节点数目范围是 <code>[0, 100]</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^4 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：p = [1, 2, 3], q = [1, 2, 3]&#10;      1         1&#10;     / \\       / \\&#10;    2   3     2   3&#10;输出：true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：p = [1, 2, 3], q = [1, 2, 3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      1         1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     / \\       / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2   3     2   3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：true</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：p = [1, 2], q = [1, null, 2]&#10;      1         1&#10;     /           \\&#10;    2             2&#10;输出：false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：p = [1, 2], q = [1, null, 2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      1         1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     /           \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2             2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：false</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：p = [1, 2, 1], q = [1, 1, 2]&#10;      1         1&#10;     / \\       / \\&#10;    2   1     1   2&#10;输出：false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：p = [1, 2, 1], q = [1, 1, 2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      1         1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     / \\       / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2   1     1   2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：false</span></span></code></pre></div><p>判断两棵树是否相同是递归思维在树结构上的经典应用。本题将帮助你建立「递归比较」的思维模型，这一模式在后续的对称树（LC #101）、子树判断等题目中会反复出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"递归定义\">递归定义</h3><p>两棵树相同，当且仅当：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>两棵树的根节点值相同</li>\n<li>两棵树的左子树相同</li>\n<li>两棵树的右子树相同</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这是一个天然的递归定义。递归的终止条件有三种情况：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情况</th>\n<th>p</th>\n<th>q</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>都为空</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>true（两个空树相同）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一个为空</td>\n<td>null/非null</td>\n<td>非null/null</td>\n<td>false（结构不同）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>都不为空</td>\n<td>非null</td>\n<td>非null</td>\n<td>比较值和子树</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"递归法分析\">递归法分析</h3><p>递归法的核心是「自顶向下」的比较策略：先比较当前节点，再递归比较子树。这种前序遍历式的比较在发现不同时能立即返回 <code>false</code>，避免了不必要的遍历。</p>\n<h3 id=\"迭代法-bfs\">迭代法（BFS）</h3><p>也可以使用广度优先搜索（BFS）来实现。将两棵树的节点按层配对放入队列，每次取出一对节点进行比较。这种方式在实际工程中更容易理解调用栈的行为。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>递归（DFS）</td>\n<td>O(min(m, n))</td>\n<td>O(min(h₁, h₂))</td>\n<td>代码最简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代（BFS）</td>\n<td>O(min(m, n))</td>\n<td>O(min(m, n))</td>\n<td>避免栈溢出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 m、n 为两棵树的节点数，h₁、h₂ 为两棵树的高度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"递归法-推荐\">递归法（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TreeNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  left: TreeNode | null;&#10;  right: TreeNode | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function isSameTree(p: TreeNode | null, q: TreeNode | null): boolean {&#10;  if (p === null &amp;&amp; q === null) {&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  if (p === null || q === null) {&#10;    return false;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return p.val === q.val &amp;&amp; isSameTree(p.left, q.left) &amp;&amp; isSameTree(p.right, q.right);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isSameTree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">q</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isSameTree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p.left, q.left) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isSameTree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p.right, q.right);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"迭代法-bfs\">迭代法（BFS）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function isSameTree(p: TreeNode | null, q: TreeNode | null): boolean {&#10;  const queue: Array&lt;[TreeNode | null, TreeNode | null]&gt; = [[p, q]];&#10;&#10;  while (queue.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    const [node1, node2] = queue.shift()!;&#10;&#10;    if (node1 === null &amp;&amp; node2 === null) {&#10;      continue;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (node1 === null || node2 === null) {&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (node1.val !== node2.val) {&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    queue.push([node1.left, node2.left]);&#10;    queue.push([node1.right, node2.right]);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return true;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isSameTree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">q</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> queue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [[p, q]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (queue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node1.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node2.val) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([node1.left, node2.left]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([node1.right, node2.right]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>递归执行过程：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>p = [1, 2, 3]</code>、<code>q = [1, 2, 3]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调用层级</th>\n<th>p.val</th>\n<th>q.val</th>\n<th>值相等</th>\n<th>递归左子树</th>\n<th>递归右子树</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第 1 层</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>进入</td>\n<td>进入</td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 2 层（左）</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>null/null</td>\n<td>null/null</td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 2 层（右）</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>null/null</td>\n<td>null/null</td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个条件（值相等、左子树相同、右子树相同）全部满足，返回 <code>true</code>。</p>\n<p>以 <code>p = [1, 2]</code>、<code>q = [1, null, 2]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调用层级</th>\n<th>p</th>\n<th>q</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第 1 层</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>值相等，继续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 2 层（左）</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>一个为空一个不为空 → false</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在第二层就提前返回了 <code>false</code>，无需遍历右子树。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(min(m, n))</td>\n<td>最多访问较小树的所有节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(min(h₁, h₂))</td>\n<td>递归栈深度取决于较矮的树</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度分析：</strong> 最好情况下，两棵树的根节点值就不同，时间为 O(1)。最坏情况下，两棵树完全相同，需要遍历所有 min(m, n) 个节点。每个节点只访问一次，因此时间为 O(min(m, n))。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度分析：</strong> 递归法的空间取决于递归栈的深度，即树的高度。最坏情况（退化为链表）为 O(n)，平衡树为 O(log n)。BFS 方法的空间取决于队列中最多同时存在的节点对数，最坏情况为 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>递归模式总结：</strong> 本题展示的「同步递归比较」模式非常重要——同时对两个结构进行递归，在每一层做对应位置的比较。这一模式直接延伸到 LC #101（对称树）中，只不过对称树是将「左-左、右-右」的比较改为「左-右、右-左」。理解了本题的递归结构，对称树的解法就水到渠成了。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 100 相同的树","id":"leetcode-100-相同的树"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"递归定义","id":"递归定义"},{"level":3,"text":"递归法分析","id":"递归法分析"},{"level":3,"text":"迭代法（BFS）","id":"迭代法-bfs"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"递归法（推荐）","id":"递归法-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"迭代法（BFS）","id":"迭代法-bfs"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 94 二叉树的中序遍历","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0094-binary-tree-inorder"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 101 对称二叉树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0101-symmetric-tree"}}